  "known_limits": [
    "CAD layout candidate, not a manufacturing release or a calibrated actuator model.",
    "New tapered palm envelope, 195mm long versus110mm; front cover grows from47mm to a shaped upper edge near140mm. Hollow shell, not solid infill.",
    "Thumb CMC root moves from[112,21,0] to[62,46,-24]mm, inside the lower palm. Thumb metacarpal has a fixed35deg MCP mounting yaw; upper thumb is not a straight continuation of its metacarpal.",
    "Hand20 axes + arm4 axes retained. Finger roots and lengths are redesigned. Root2axis mechanical submodule and stock motor/frame interfaces are reused.",
    "Palm structural thickness89mm includes the actual stacked root motor envelopes; 3D print layer strength and weight not validated.",
    "Arm motor shapes remain nominal cylinders; vendor flange details, bearings, wiring and strength are pending. Existing90paths and speed results do not apply.",
    "Explicit floor windows preserve16mm load rails, motor wall pads and fastener lands.6mm ribs and chamfered wall openings reduce mass; cover skin2.4mm with4mm lands. Tip interiors are hollowed without changing joint centers. Structural strength remains unverified.",
    "Forearm extension V4.1: elbow-to-wrist-flex axis distance280mm (was220); elbow-to-roll130mm (was100). Hand and wrist interfaces unchanged. Longer proximal carrier and hollow beam are regenerated, not scaled motor meshes. Elbow gravity and acceleration margins must be reassessed.",
    "Assembly review correction: factory S101 head seat Z=-11.8mm and H101 head seat Y=15.8mm were verified by BRep ray intersections. Original M2x6 has full nominal nut engagement;2.2mm nut pockets improve nominal protrusion from0.1 to0.4mm. No additional H101/S101 head machining.1.6mm nuts and low heads diameter3mm,height0.6mm. All hardware dimensions require physical fit confirmation.",
    "Assembly review: printed root-seat tool corridors diameter3.5mm allow2.8mm straight screwdriver shaft before motors/cover installation; root-frame order must follow the CAD tool-blocking graph. Cover changes to5xM3x10 with side-loaded AF5.5x2.4 nuts near the top of12mm bosses; no90mm cover bolts. Tool/hand ergonomics, printed tolerances and strength remain physical bench checks.",
    "Round6: add8 M3x14 palm mounting screws and nuts, plus4 body M2x8 TAP and8 horn/idler M2x4 TAP per actuator. Printed root carrier left edge relieved0.6mm. Thread engagement is explicit; threads and screw drives remain simplified.",
    "Round7: move thumb cartridge bolts to localX[-19,20],Y[-28,8]mm; add root body screw tool corridors through floor and thumb flange; remove0.01mm nut-pocket lip; H101 TAP Y=-6mm seat corrected outboard0.1mm based on actual BRep material boundary, other6 TAP seats unchanged.",
    "V7 index root fixed wall becomes a removable cartridge. Build its S101/motor/hinge outside palm, seat a printed foot in a locating lip, then fit two M3x12 screws from below. Other roots are retained as V6 pending this proof.",
    "V8: four finger cartridges and top-installed thumb foot preserve joint axes. Closed box load rails carry V6 stiffness concept; new cartridge load paths require fresh structural checks."
  ],
